                  "children": [
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-en"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "SINHAGAD FORT"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-mr-text deva"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "किल्ले सिंहगड"
                      ]
                    },
                    " "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Originally known as Kondhana, this massive fort near Pune holds profound emotional weight. In 1670, it was the site of a legendary battle when Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj tasked his trusted commander, ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "Tanaji Malusare"
                      ]
                    },
                    ", with recapturing it from the Mughals. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Tanaji fought fiercely and conquered the fort, but lost his life in the struggle. The well-known saying ",
                    {
                      "tag": "em",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "\"Gad aala, pan Sinha gela\""
                      ]
                    },
                    " belongs to later tradition; its exact wording and the story of the fort’s renaming are not established here as contemporary testimony. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " पुण्याजवळील या प्रचंड किल्ल्याचे मूळ नाव कोंढाणा होते. १६७० मध्ये महाराजांनी आपला शूर आणि विश्वासू सरदार ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "तानाजी मालुसरे"
                      ]
                    },
                    " याच्यावर हा किल्ला मुघलांकडून परत मिळवण्याची जबाबदारी सोपवली. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " तानाजीने अत्यंत चिवट लढा देऊन किल्ला सर केला, परंतु या लढाईत त्याला वीरमरण आले. ",
                    {
                      "tag": "em",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "\"गड आला, पण सिंह गेला!\""
                      ]
                    },
                    " हे वाक्य नंतरच्या परंपरेत प्रसिद्ध झाले; त्याचे अचूक शब्द आणि नामांतराची कथा येथे समकालीन पुरावा म्हणून मांडलेली नाही. "
                  ]
                },
                " "
              ]
            },
            " "
          ]
        },
